---
<ContentPage title="Karinderya Stoves" description="Compare Karinderya Basic, Standard, and Deluxe Stove tiers for your kitchen." kicker="Equipment database" intro="Compare the Basic, Standard, and Deluxe cooking-station progression." parent={{ label: 'Equipment', href: '/equipment/' }} relatedLinks={[{ label: 'Deluxe Stove', href: '/equipment/deluxe-stove/' }, { label: 'Equipment', href: '/equipment/' }, { label: 'Recipes', href: '/recipes/' }]} sourceIds={['wiki-furniture', 'deluxe-guide']} tableOfContents>
  <h2 id="stove-overview">Stove Overview</h2>
  <p>Stoves are cooking stations used to prepare customer orders. The progression covered here contains three named tiers: Basic Stove, Standard Stove, and Deluxe Stove. Higher tiers are described as reducing cooking time.</p>

  <h2 id="basic-stove">Basic Stove</h2>
  <p><a href="/equipment/basic-stove/">Basic Stove</a> is the first item in the three-tier order and serves as the starting point for the stove progression.</p>

  <h2 id="standard-stove">Standard Stove</h2>
  <p><a href="/equipment/standard-stove/">Standard Stove</a> appears after Basic Stove and before Deluxe Stove, making it the middle step in the progression.</p>

  <h2 id="deluxe-stove">Deluxe Stove</h2>
  <p><a href="/equipment/deluxe-stove/">Deluxe Stove</a> is the highest tier in this list. It is also included in the <code>2MVISITS</code> code reward.</p>

  <h2 id="choosing-a-stove">Choosing a Stove</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Basic Stove comes before Standard Stove.</li>
    <li>Standard Stove comes before Deluxe Stove.</li>
    <li>Higher tiers are broadly described as reducing cooking time.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>Higher tiers help reduce cooking time, while additional stations let the kitchen handle orders in parallel. Choose between upgrading a stove and adding another station based on the current needs of your restaurant.</p>

  <FAQ items={faqItems} />
</ContentPage>
